        "loc-quay"
      ],
      "playerDescription": "Molly is {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-49}}.\n\nHer hair is {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-50:sHair}} and her eyes are {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-51:sEye Color}}.\n\nShe is {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-52:sBuild}} — {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-53:sBuild>sHeight}} and {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-54:sBuild>sFrame}}.",
      "aiDescription": "{{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-55}}. The northern one specifically would be {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-56:vnorth}}, whose hair is {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-57:vnorth>vhair-north}}. Freckles, if she has any: {{ph:molly:world:pl-molly-58:sFreckles}}."
    },
